gdrive-sync (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of BearSync (gdrive-sync) for Debian / Ubuntu.
  * Native Wayland & KDE Plasma 6 StatusNotifierItem system tray integration.
  * Bi-directional differential sync engine with SQLite WAL caching, 3-second
    inotify write debounce, conflict resolution, and timestamp versioning.

 -- BearSync Contributors <maintainers@bearsync.org>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:00:00 -0500
